    "overview": "Thread extends the approved native-style reading world: quiet neutral surfaces, readable system sans, blue interaction cues, compact settings and local context beside native content. Pear Crystal identifies THREAD with the owned orange faceted gem in assets/thread-gem.svg; keep its geometry free of letters or pictograms. Sole product authorship is expDARE.\n\nThe default menu follows native site colors with light/dark fallbacks. The optional gem menu theme adds warm dark surfaces and orange accents only to THREAD menu and notice surfaces. It starts off. This document captures an established implementation, not a replacement visual identity.",
